# Worker vars for local `npm run dev`. Copy to .dev.vars.
#
# The CMS (posts, media, auth) lives in the standalone `cms/` Worker.
# This site only reads published posts from it. Local CMS defaults to:
#   cd cms && npm run dev
CMS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5175

# Optional: Cloudflare Access service token for the CMS. Only needed if the
# CMS Access policy does not exempt /api/posts* and /media/*.
# CMS_ACCESS_CLIENT_ID=
# CMS_ACCESS_CLIENT_SECRET=
